<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>FOV 90 SENS 0.97 1920x1080</Major>
    <Description>
      Resolution: 1920x1080
      Field of View (FOV): 90
      Sensitivity: 0.97
      Aiming Sensitivity: 0.75

      Accurate spray control up to approximately 23 bullets, designed for personal use. If you like it, I will refine it to support 30 bullets.
      Works only with correct settings!
      In the RUST console, use: input.sensitivity 0.97
    </Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
